<title>SINGAPORE: Guthrie gets SES nod to list bond, share.</title>
<headline>Guthrie gets SES nod to list bond, share.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guthrie GTS Ltd said on Friday the Stock Exchange of Singapore (SES) had given it approval to list its bonds, warrants and new shares.</p>
<p>The company had announced late last year it planned to issue Singapore $130 million worth of 3.0 percent bonds due in 2002.</p>
<p>These comprise S$75 million of secured bonds and S$55 million of unsecured bonds with up to 199.02 million detachable warrants to subscribe for up to 199.02 million new ordinary Guthrie shares of S$0.20 each.</p>
<p>The issue is being arranged and lead-managed by ABN AMRO Bank N.V. Singapore branch.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
